    "description": "The Extend Car Rental Reservations API enables users to modify existing car rental reservations by extending their duration. This operation is essential for customers who wish to prolong their rental period without requiring a new reservation. Typical consumers include customers in need of additional rental time and car rental agency staff managing bookings. The API streamlines this process, ensuring that users can efficiently adjust their plans while maintaining compliance with rental policies.",
